"""Summarize retained complete matrices and current screening evidence."""
import json,math,statistics
from pathlib import Path
root=Path('/private/tmp/light-ultra');rs=json.loads((root/'evidence/decomposition.json').read_text())['runs'];iterations=json.loads((root/'evidence/iterations-resumed.json').read_text())
def fmt(x,d=0):return 'unknown' if x is None else f'{x:,.{d}f}'
def metrics(xs):
 n=len(xs);times=sorted(x['wall_s'] for x in xs)
 return [f"{sum(x['effective'] for x in xs)}/{n}",fmt(statistics.mean(x['total'] for x in xs) if all(x['total'] is not None for x in xs) else None),f"{statistics.median(times):.1f} / {times[math.ceil(n*.9)-1]:.1f}",fmt(statistics.mean(x['N'] for x in xs),2),('>=' if any(x['total'] is None for x in xs) else '')+fmt(sum(x['cost_usd'] or 0 for x in xs),6)]
def cohort(agent,model,task=None):
 phases=['baseline'] if agent in ('pi','normal') else ['candidate-batch-subset','candidate-selected-new','candidate-selected-repeat2']
 return [r for r in rs if r['agent']==agent and r['phase'] in phases and r['model']==model and (task is None or r['task']==task)]
lines=['# AgenC Light measured progress report','', '**Round 2 is still in progress. The owner target has not been met.** The latest complete two-repeat candidate remains selected9e7; its full comparison is below. New minimal profiles are screened separately, with every failure retained. The compact-frame candidate has passed all eight screening tasks and reduced tokens on both models; median time is still above Pi. The schema-order screen also completes8/8. Frames is selected for48confirmation cells at exact11e51dcc1; its earlier55cfscreening is not pooled into acceptance. Full regressions are active. No recommendation to enable Light by default is justified yet.','', '## Full retained comparison','', 'Twelve pinned real-repository tasks, two repeats on each model. Tokens include cached input, uncached input and all output including reasoning. A task passes only if the agent finishes and all artifact/tool checks pass. Ten legacy calls have unrecoverable usage; normal-mode affected token totals remain unknown and costs remain observed lower bounds.','', '| Model / agent | Effective | Tokens/task | Median / p90 s | Calls/task | Total USD |','| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |']
for model in ['deepseek-flash','deepseek-v4-pro']:
 for agent in ['pi','normal','light']:
  xs=cohort(agent,model);assert len(xs)==24
  lines.append('| '+model+' / '+agent+' | '+' | '.join(metrics(xs))+' |')
lines+=['','The selected9e7candidate loses completion, tokens and wall time against Pi. Its48cells reuse8screening cells plus40previously missing cells; this is explicit screening reuse, not an independent confirmation sample. All144baseline cells remain unchanged.','', '## Per-task comparison','']
for model in ['deepseek-flash','deepseek-v4-pro']:
 lines += [f'### {model}','','| Task / agent | Effective | Tokens/task | Median / p90 s | Calls/task | Total USD |','| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |']
 for task in sorted({r['task'] for r in cohort('pi',model)}):
  for agent in ['pi','normal','light']:lines.append('| '+task+' / '+agent+' | '+' | '.join(metrics(cohort(agent,model,task)))+' |')
lines+=['','## Round 2 screening','','Each candidate uses four tasks and one repeat/model. Pi comparisons reuse both retained repeats. These are screening measurements, not final acceptance. Fixed-catalog planning actions are recorded separately because its deliberately non-deferred startup fails the original Light discovery invariant.','', '| Candidate / model | Effective | Artifacts | Tokens/task | Median / p90 s | Calls/task | USD |','| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |']
for x in iterations['rows']:
 if not any(k in x['phase'] for k in ['parity','catalog-subset','demand-subset','notice','frames','stable']):continue
 lines.append('| '+x['phase']+' / '+x['model']+' | '+f"{x['effective']}/{x['runs']} | {x['artifact']}/{x['runs']} | {fmt(x['mean_tokens'])} | {x['median']:.1f} / {x['p90']:.1f} | {x['mean_calls']:.2f} | {fmt(x['cost_usd'],6)} |")
lines+=['', '## What the measurements show','', '- The independent four-tool head is smaller than Pi. Task01 parity1: system386bytes/87raw tokens and schema1881bytes/465raw tokens, versus Pi2343bytes/553tokens and2953bytes/658tokens. Provider first input972versus1616 on Flash. Raw component tokenization excludes provider framing.', '- Parity3 Pro still generated6510reasoning tokens per task versus Pi3401 on the subset. Its excess history residual was192986tokens/task; excess mean model duration57.5s versus2.5s tool-plus-runtime residual. Prompt effects are observational, not a causal estimate from one repeat.', '- Demand guidance reduced Pro history residual to370340 and reasoning to5125, but both models still skipped one explicitly requested planning action after its schema appeared. A corrected availability notice after the entire result batch restores 8/8 completion. It adds no model turn.', '- The stable full catalog loses:13723raw prefix tokens versus631for parity3,596483Flash/964643Pro total tokens per task. Deferred loading remains selected as the architecture.', '- Paired zero-provider fixtures reduce median Light inter-call work from71–76ms to39–42ms, still above Pi2.7–2.8ms. Canonical persistence, permission admission and effect receipts remain intact. Polling averages0–0.25results/task in parity3 and cannot explain the dominant gap.', '- Large command captures are now retrievable through a durable reference after clipping. Older messages and the system prefix remain unchanged.','', 'Compact-frame subset: Flash144648 tokens/task,53.29/79.29s median/p90,15.25calls; Pro281465tokens/task,127.48/172.39s,20.5calls. Both are4/4effective. Pi retained subset:260379/330880tokens,52.42/101.16s and116.68/184.51s. These remain one-repeat screens. A separate initial frame cohort had8zero-provider startup failures from a missing native binding; all are retained.', '', 'A burst-stream zero-provider profile (128reasoning chunks per request) measures Light134ms versusPi5.7ms median inter-call gap, with Light CPU profiling overhead included. Canonical fsync and SQLite admission/effect transactions dominate observed runtime work. Removing durability is not justified by these results.', '', 'The complete per-run decomposition and deltas against Pi are in [STATUS.md](STATUS.md), backed by [decomposition.json](evidence/decomposition.json). Historical Pi TTFT/generation and exact tool/overhead split were not recorded and cannot be recovered without prohibited reruns. AgenC tool/overhead estimates are explicitly labeled.','', '## Validation and PRs','', 'Core main31236passed/27failed/11skipped. Parity3 full31245/90/11; all27baseline failures recur. The63additions are61normal-mode accessor failures and2Light child identity assertions. The production fixes pass261affected-file tests; notice integration passes365checks. Integrated notice full suite: 31313/27/11, exactly the same 27 failure identities as main and zero new failures. The later batch-order fix passes 80 checks, frame/replay checks 94 plus 28, and schema-order checks 89. Latest integrated full validation is running. Output-reference checks44passed. Source/test-support typechecks pass.','', 'Desktop main5237/1/32; candidate5238/1/32, the same failure and zero new failures. Desktop typecheck passed. Light stays default-off with the experimental label. Sessions have a mode indicator and a fresh-session switch. No protocol bump; eventual integration needs a Core pin containing accepted changes.','', '| PR | Scope | Current evidence |','| --- | --- | --- |','| [Core2796](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2796) | Lean head and tool loading | Draft; full9e7matrix misses gate |','| [Core2809](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2809) | Result bounds | Draft; measured with selected9e7 |','| [Core2812](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2812) | Independent four-tool profile | Draft; initial head smaller, full-task gate unmet |','| [Core2813](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2813) | Command settling and derived index coalescing | Draft; offline runtime improvement, no overhead-parity claim |','| [Core2814](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2814) | Retrievable clipped output | Draft;44checks pass |','| [Core2815](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2815) | Requested-capability notice | Draft;8/8 subset quality, full suite zero new failures |','| [Core2816](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2816) | Compact workspace result frames | Draft;8/8 subset quality, lower tokens and p90 on both models |','| [Core2817](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2817) | Stable discovery order | Draft;89 checks pass, screen8/8, unselected |','| [Proof2797](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2797) | Portable benchmark and analytic evidence | Draft;39offline checks pass |','| [Desktop481](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-desktop/pull/481) | Mode indicator and new-session switch | Draft;zero new Linux failures |','| [Core2810](https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/agenc-core/pull/2810) | Earlier focused-work experiment | Closed, unselected negative result retained |','', 'Nothing merged, released or deployed. Shared-file changes are confined to Light presentation/discovery/runtime options, normal-mode compatibility and child prompt identity; Goal and child routing state machines are unchanged.','', '## Limits and remaining work','', '- Current target is unmet. Select from the completed frame and schema-order screens, then confirm the strongest candidate over all12tasks/two repeats without rerunning finished cells. Finish full validation and refresh PR evidence.', '- The task harness is process based. One selected Flash task03root search exposed validation-fixture filenames; no subsequent read of fixture content was observed. This limitation remains in [TRACE-AUDIT.md](TRACE-AUDIT.md).', '- Latest clean-room screen181changed files versus701Pi package files: zero added8/12/20-gram matches. One earlier8-gram identifier-expression overlap was rewritten. All counts/hashes are in [similarity-latest.json](evidence/similarity-latest.json). This lexical screen does not prove semantic originality.', '- Checker v2 accepts actual automatic schema discovery followed by successful planning. All38older completed task12traces retain identical outcomes; original records and legacy fields remain. The two new demand failures are retained.', '- DeepSeek cap is35USD on the complete reconciled ledger, with10USD account floor and at most2runs. Latest recorded conservative charge was14.351672USD before later calls; final ledger reconciliation remains pending. Luna had41requests, subscription cost unpriced, with no usable final performance comparison; no proxy was started or reconfigured.', '- Final credential scan of every created task artifact on both machines and newly created Git objects remains pending while work is active. Earlier scan records are historical, not final clearance.','']
(root/'REPORT.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines))
